he SQLite\ndriver tests cover storage, ownership, duplicate delivery, rollback and the outbox.\nNo test changes a Vatly account. See ",[554,555,556],"a",{"href":424},"offline examples"," for host tests.",[497,559,561],{"id":560},"check-formatting-and-types","Check formatting and types",[506,563,565],{"className":508,"code":564,"language":510,"meta":511,"style":511},"uv run ruff check .\nuv run ruff format --check .\nuv run mypy\n",[513,566,567,582,599],{"__ignoreMap":511},[516,568,569,571,573,576,579],{"class":518,"line":519},[516,570,539],{"class":522},[516,572,543],{"class":542},[516,574,575],{"class":542}," ruff",[516,577,578],{"class":542}," check",[516,580,581],{"class":542}," .\n",[516,583,585,587,589,591,594,597],{"class":518,"line":584},2,[516,586,539],{"class":522},[516,588,543],{"class":542},[516,590,575],{"class":542},[516,592,593],{"class":542}," format",[516,595,596],{"class":542}," --check",[516,598,581],{"class":542},[516,600,602,604,606],{"class":518,"line":601},3,[516,603,539],{"class":522},[516,605,543],{"class":542},[516,607,608],{"class":542}," mypy\n",[502,610,611],{},"CI runs tests and these checks on Python 3.10–3.14. Type checks also include the\nexample storage driver.",[497,613,615],{"id":614},"build-and-check-the-package","Build and check the package",[506,617,619],{"className":508,"code":618,"language":510,"meta":511,"style":511},"uv build\nuv run twine check dist\u002F*\nuv run python scripts\u002Fcheck_package.py\n",[513,620,621,628,646],{"__ignoreMap":511},[516,622,623,625],{"class":518,"line":519},[516,624,539],{"class":522},[516,626,627],{"class":542}," build\n",[516,629,630,632,634,637,639,642],{"class":518,"line":584},[516,631,539],{"class":522},[516,633,543],{"class":542},[516,635,636],{"class":542}," twine",[516,638,578],{"class":542},[516,640,641],{"class":542}," dist\u002F",[516,643,645],{"class":644},"sTEyZ","*\n",[516,647,648,650,652,655],{"class":518,"line":601},[516,649,539],{"class":522},[516,651,543],{"class":542},[516,653,654],{"class":542}," python",[516,656,657],{"class":542}," scripts\u002Fcheck_package.py\n",[502,659,660,661,664],{},"The last command installs the built wheel in a fresh environment and checks\nimports and ",[513,662,663],{},"py.typed",". These commands do not publish anything.",[497,666,668],{"id":667},"pinned-sdk-dependency","Pinned SDK dependency",[502,670,671,672,675,676,679,680,683,684,687],{},"Fluent pins one exact ",[513,673,674],{},"vatly-api-python"," version from PyPI in ",[513,677,678],{},"pyproject.toml",";\n",[513,681,682],{},"uv.lock"," records its hashes. To move to a new SDK version, change the pin, run\n",[513,685,686],{},"uv lock",", and run the full checks. Use a new Fluent alpha version when dependency\nbehavior changes.",[497,689,691],{"id":690},"documentation-sync","Documentation sync",[502,693,694,695,698,699,702,703,706,707,710,711,714,715,718],{},"Keep guides directly under ",[513,696,697],{},"docs\u002F"," and link each page from ",[554,700,701],{"href":397},"the overview",".\nPushes to ",[513,704,705],{},"main"," affecting ",[513,708,709],{},"docs\u002F**"," notify ",[513,712,713],{},"vatly\u002Fvatly-docs",". The notifier needs\n",[513,716,717],{},"VATLY_DOCS_DISPATCH_TOKEN"," with Contents: write access to that repository.\nThe sync uses an explicit frontmatter description when present, otherwise the\npage's introductory sentence.",[497,720,722],{"id":721},"prepare-a-release","Prepare a release",[502,724,725,726,732,733,736],{},"The published package is ",[554,727,731],{"href":728,"rel":729},"https:\u002F\u002Fpypi.org\u002Fproject\u002Fvatly-fluent-python\u002F",[730],"nofollow","vatly-fluent-python",";\nthe import name is ",[513,734,735],{},"vatly_fluent",". Publish the matching SDK version first, then\nFluent, then Django, only after review and approval.",[738,739,740,753],"table",{},[741,742,743],"thead",{},[744,745,746,750],"tr",{},[747,748,749],"th",{},"PyPI trusted publisher field",[747,751,752],{},"Value",[754,755,756,767,776,